Z||000000||AutoXdbdragSE||11-17-2001||07:30 PM||||So, i was at a light, and these 3 kids pull up beside me in a civic.. riced out.. mismatched color front clip, carbon fiber hood, big wing.. the usual.   And they start pointin at me and laughin..  so i'm not normally one to race, but they pissed me off, so i put it in nuetral.. rev it.. let them know it's go time.  I drop it back in gear and i hear his tin can blarin as he tries to show me up.  At this point i know it's on.. i see the light go yellow on the street accross me, so i put my foot on the brake, foot on the gas bring it up to 3,000 and the light goes green.  I take off, spin both tires for about 5 feet then i catch, and i'm out in front of the guy.. about a carlink.. i stay there till 50, we where in a 35 zone, so i lift because i don't have anything more to prove. next light he is beside me again.. he's embarrased.. the other kids in the car are laughing at him.. all and all i'd say it was a fun kill.<P>oh i forgot to metntion.. the 3800 was in a pontiac TranSPORT.  ||||reg||1
